based on Article 78 paragraph 4 of the Federal Constitution,in implementation of the Nagoya Protocol of 29 October 2010 on Access to Genetic Resources and the Fair and Equitable Sharing of Benefits Arising from their Utilization to the Convention on Biological Diversity (Nagoya Protocol),and having considered the Federal Council Dispatch dated 12 November 1965,
decrees:
